//api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-23T09:23:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T15:05:19Z","closed_at":"2025-03-24T15:05:18Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"- *Production edit: See https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs-user-notes/discussions/210#discussioncomment-12584036.*\n\n### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable (4c311cbee) - Nobara Linux 41 (GNOME Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 (nvidia; 570.124.04) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8750H CPU @ 2.20GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `env` property of `CharFXTransform` is a dictionary of the arguments passed into the bbcode tag corresponding to a custom `RichTextEffect`.  \nAccording to the [documentation page](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_charfxtransform.html#class-charfxtransform-property-env), it is supposed to automatically convert the values to `bool`, `int` or `float` when their content matches, however I found by testing that integer values will be converted to float, not int.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a script inheriting `CharFXTransform`:\n```gdscript\nextends RichTextEffect\nclass_name TestEffect\n\nvar bbcode := \"test\"\n\nvar processed = false\n\nfunc _process_custom_fx(char_fx: CharFXTransform) -> bool:\n\tif processed: return true\n\tfor key in char_fx.env:\n\t\tvar val = char_fx.env[key]\n\t\tprint(\"{0}: {1} ({2})\".format([key, val, type_string(typeof(val))]))\n\tprocessed = true\n\treturn true\n```\n\nCreate a Scene with a `RichTextLabel`, add `TestEffect` to its `custom_effects` property, check `bbcode_enabled` and add some text containing a test tag, like this: `[test int_var=2 float_var=0.5]text` (some text after the tag is necessary for `_process_custom_fx` to be called).  \nYou can change the `layout_mode` to \"Anchors\" and the `anchors_preset` to \"Full Rect\" to actually see the text but it's not necessary.\n\nRunning the scene with the given text will print out:\n```log\nint_var: 2.0 (float)\nfloat_var: 0.5 (float)\n```\n\nWe can see that the `int_var` value that should be converted to int was converted to float instead.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[CharFXTransform bug MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19408080/CharFXTransform.bug.MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104506/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104506/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}